::Q1::What is the main advantage of using cloud computing?
{
    ~ You can make the application secure
    ~ You pay for server costs upfront
    = It is easier to scale an application
    ~ You can deploy a monolithic architecture
}

::Q2::What are the different types of services provided in cloud?
{
    ~ IaaS, Paas, ZaaS
    ~ IaaS, Aaas, SaaS
    = IaaS, Paas, SaaS
    ~ IaaS, Qaas, AaaS
}

::Q3::What are the different types of cloud computing?
{
    ~ private
    ~ public
    ~ hybrid
    = All the above 
}